      "message": "`ModuleConfig` must not store a raw pointer to `IModule`, because this can easily lead to use after free problems. However, we don\u0027t want to use a shared pointer either in order to avoid holding the module instance. The correct approach is to pass a raw pointer to `IModule` here as well.",
