      "message": "There seems to be a misunderstanding what does \"attached\" mean. It does not mean \"currently connected,\" instead, \"attached\" is used to label devices that are permanently connected (the value of `connection` in their type is empty), see line 95. I would suggest adding another set like `std::set\u003cint32_t\u003e mConnectedExternalDevicePorts` to hold ids of these ports.",
